# Firebase client SDK config for the production build deployed to
# https://youarepilates-e202c.web.app (Firebase Hosting, Next.js web frameworks
# integration — `firebase deploy --only hosting`). These are NOT secrets: they end
# up in every visitor's browser bundle regardless, so this file is committed.
